\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"urban planning\",\"categories\":[\"Transit, cities & urban planning\"],\"tags\":[\"urbanism\",\"public transit\",\"car dependence\",\"density\",\"rail\"],\"quote\":\"For a video describing how wrong it is, refer to Not Just Bikes\",\"recommenders\":4,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"RQv5CVELG3U\",\"title\":\"The Delayed Choice Quantum Eraser, Debunked\",\"channel\":\"Sabine Hossenfelder\",\"summary\":\"Sabine Hossenfelder explains the delayed choice quantum eraser and argues it does not rewrite the past, as popular accounts claim. She walks through what the experiment actually shows.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it as a clear debunking of the retrocausality interpretation of the quantum eraser.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"quantum eraser experiment\",\"categories\":[\"Quantum physics\"],\"tags\":[\"quantum mechanics\",\"delayed choice\",\"retrocausality\",\"double slit\",\"physics\"],\"quote\":\"Later Sabine Hossenfelder did a video debunking the proposition that DCQE somehow showed that the past was being rewritten.\",\"recommenders\":5,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"RTB5XhjbgZA\",\"title\":\"Segmented Displays\",\"channel\":\"Posy\",\"summary\":\"Posy explores segmented displays, from the seven-segment display to alternative designs with fewer or more segments, with patents and history.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a meditative, geeky tour of alternative display designs.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"segmented displays\",\"categories\":[\"Product & industrial design\",\"Graphic design & typography\",\"Audio & video engineering\"],\"tags\":[\"seven-segment\",\"displays\",\"design history\",\"posy\",\"patents\"],\"quote\":\"here is a meditative video on alternative segmented displays.\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"RUwS1uAdUcI\",\"title\":\"Hans Rosling: Debunking third-world myths with the best stats you've ever seen\",\"