 the strangeness of the mainstream views. It is aimed at curious lay viewers.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters regularly send people to it as an accessible, friendly introduction whenever pilot wave theory comes up.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"quantum interpretations\",\"categories\":[\"Quantum physics\"],\"tags\":[\"pilot wave theory\",\"bohmian mechanics\",\"quantum mechanics\",\"hidden variables\",\"physics\"],\"quote\":\"Here's another great video from PBS Spacetime on this topic\",\"recommenders\":4,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"RxD6H3ri8RI\",\"title\":\"Wild Tricks for Greenscreen in Blender\",\"channel\":\"IanHubert\",\"summary\":\"Ian Hubert shows quick, unconventional tricks for greenscreen compositing in Blender, as a follow-up to his motion tracking video.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a favorite among practical Blender guides from a hugely productive solo artist.\",\"content_type\":\"tutorial\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"blender compositing\",\"categories\":[\"Animation & visual effects\"],\"tags\":[\"blender\",\"greenscreen\",\"vfx\",\"ian hubert\",\"compositing\"],\"quote\":\"My favourite guides of his are not in the Lazy Tutorials playlist, though.\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"SMEOKDVXlUo\",\"title\":\"Blockchain vs. Bullshit: Thoughts on the Future of Money [Classic Bitcoin & Open Blockchain  Talk]\",\"channel\":\"aantonop\",\"summary\":\"Andreas Antonopoulos explains how to tell Bitcoin-style blockchains from corporate blockchain hype. He argues the goal should be de-banking everyone rather than banking the unbanked.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters recommend it as a corrective to enterprise blockchain marketing and as an explanation of what makes Bitcoin distinctive.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"bitcoin and blockchain\",\"categories\":[\"Cryptography\",\"Futurism & technology and society\"],\"tags\":[\"bitcoin\",\"blockchain hype\",\"an