ests it as a skill worth practicing for an hour.\",\"content_type\":\"tutorial\",\"level\":\"intro\",\"primary_topic\":\"chicken deboning\",\"categories\":[\"Cooking & food\"],\"tags\":[\"jacques pepin\",\"cooking\",\"knife skills\",\"deboning\",\"technique\"],\"quote\":\"Pepin's chicken deboning video is the best cooking video that has ever or will ever be put on the Internet\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"ngpsJKQR_ZE\",\"title\":\"I'm Allowed to Rob You!\",\"channel\":\"Larken Rose\",\"summary\":\"A short anarchist-leaning video by Larken Rose arguing that the Constitution and similar documents cannot legitimately grant anyone the right to take other people's property. It uses a rhetorical 'paper that lets me rob you' setup to challenge belief in political authority.\",\"why_hn\":\"Libertarian-minded commenters post it in surveillance, government and constitution threads as a red-pill argument that political authority is illusory.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"political authority\",\"categories\":[\"Philosophy & ethics\",\"Politics & history (other)\"],\"tags\":[\"anarchism\",\"taxation\",\"constitution\",\"libertarianism\",\"government legitimacy\"],\"quote\":\"Here's all you need to know about the Constitution\",\"recommenders\":4,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"nmgFG7PUHfo\",\"title\":\"The Most Underrated Algorithm\",\"channel\":\"Veritasium\",\"summary\":\"Veritasium tells the story of the Fast Fourier Transform, from its use in detecting nuclear tests to Cold War politics, and how it could have changed the arms race. It includes a short, intuitive explanation of what the Fourier transform does.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN points people to it as the explanation that finally made Fourier transforms and the FFT click, with a good historical story.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"fast fourier transform\",\"categories\":[\"Information theory & signal processing\",\"Algorithms