le creates interference after double slit - Wave particle duality at the workshop\",\"channel\":\"heligone\",\"summary\":\"A short demo of a walking droplet on a vibrating silicone oil bath passing through a double slit and producing interference, a macro-scale analogue of pilot-wave behavior.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN users share it to build intuition about wave-particle duality and pilot-wave ideas in quantum mechanics threads.\",\"content_type\":\"demo\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"double slit experiment\",\"categories\":[\"Quantum physics\",\"Everyday physics & science demos\"],\"tags\":[\"double slit\",\"pilot wave\",\"walking droplets\",\"wave-particle duality\",\"quantum analogue\"],\"quote\":\"If you want to develop intuition, look at this video\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"nvK8fua6O64\",\"title\":\"TUN: Un-Ruining the MMO\",\"channel\":\"MrBtongue\",\"summary\":\"MrBtongue argues that modern theme-park MMOs lost what made earlier sandbox online games compelling, and that MMOs could be saved by returning to sandbox design.\",\"why_hn\":\"Commenters call it one of the best, most insightful explanations of sandbox versus theme-park MMO design.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"mmo game design\",\"categories\":[\"Gaming culture & analysis\",\"Game design\"],\"tags\":[\"mmo\",\"sandbox games\",\"theme park\",\"eve online\",\"world of warcraft\"],\"quote\":\"it's one of the best videos explaining this concept.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"oOttvpjJvAo\",\"title\":\"How The Auto Industry Carjacked The American Dream | Climate Town\",\"channel\":\"Climate Town\",\"summary\":\"A Climate Town video on how the auto industry reshaped American cities and culture through advertising, lobbying and campaigns like the 1939 World's Fair. It is snarky in tone but backed by a published source document.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended in urbanism threads as a well-sourced account of how car dependency