    ",{\"vid\":\"35Idb_lCU4o\",\"title\":\"COVID-19 Vaccines: MODERNA | PFIZER/BIONTECH | ASTRAZENECA\",\"channel\":\"Ninja Nerd\",\"summary\":\"A Ninja Nerd whiteboard lecture on the Moderna, Pfizer/BioNTech and AstraZeneca COVID-19 vaccines. It covers how each works, the preclinical and phase I-III trial process, and Operation Warp Speed.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommended it in late 2020 as a detailed, science-based explanation of how the different vaccines work and how they were tested.\",\"content_type\":\"lecture\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"covid-19 vaccines\",\"categories\":[\"Medicine & infectious disease\",\"Biology & biotechnology\"],\"tags\":[\"mrna\",\"clinical trials\",\"pfizer\",\"moderna\",\"astrazeneca\",\"immunology\"],\"quote\":\"This is the best science based informative video I have seen on how these different Covid vaccines actually work.\",\"recommenders\":4,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"37wFVVVZlVU\",\"title\":\"Let's #TalkConcurrency Panel Discussion with Sir Tony Hoare, Joe Armstrong, and Carl Hewitt\",\"channel\":\"Erlang Solutions\",\"summary\":\"A panel with Tony Hoare, Joe Armstrong and Carl Hewitt, hosted by Francesco Cesarini, on the history and future of concurrency. The three creators of CSP, Erlang and the actor model discuss their differing approaches.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it for getting the inventors of major concurrency models together, disagreements included.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"concurrency models\",\"categories\":[\"Distributed systems\",\"Functional programming\",\"Computability & complexity theory\"],\"tags\":[\"actor model\",\"csp\",\"erlang\",\"tony hoare\",\"joe armstrong\",\"carl hewitt\"],\"quote\":\"It was interesting hearing them discuss their different thoughts and approaches\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"3EPTfOTC4Jw\",\"title\":\"The REAL Story On Why Space Cadet Pinball Was Removed (ft. Windows on Itanium)\",\"channel\":\"NCo