are, security, open instruction sets and agile chip development.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN repeatedly recommends it as the best overview of the past, present and future of chip performance after Moore's law.\",\"content_type\":\"lecture\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"computer architecture\",\"categories\":[\"Computer architecture & CPUs\"],\"tags\":[\"turing award\",\"risc\",\"domain-specific architectures\",\"moore's law\",\"risc-v\",\"hennessy and patterson\"],\"quote\":\"I consistently recommend Hennessy and Patterson's Turing Award Talk[1] as a good overview of the past, present and future of chip performance.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"3TFz1xqp3us\",\"title\":\"Driving Amazon’s ELECTRIC Delivery Vehicle: Rivian EDV\",\"channel\":\"Friday Adventure Club\",\"summary\":\"A first-day ride-along with an Amazon delivery driver using the Rivian electric delivery van. She covers the van's new technology, how it compares to the standard Ford Transit delivery vehicles, and quirks and issues she noticed on the job.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN points to it as a rare review from an actual delivery driver rather than a car reviewer, showing how the van's design suits the job.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"electric delivery vans\",\"categories\":[\"Cars, EVs & motorcycles\",\"Business & economics (other)\"],\"tags\":[\"rivian\",\"amazon delivery\",\"electric vehicles\",\"driver review\",\"last-mile logistics\"],\"quote\":\"I started watching it thinking “I’ll only watch a minute or two” and got so engrossed I watched the whole thing.\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"3TX3kV3TICU\",\"title\":\"Let Vim Do the Typing\",\"channel\":\"thoughtbot\",\"summary\":\"George Brocklehurst of thoughtbot demonstrates Vim's built-in completion mechanisms, from word, line and block completion to ctags. The aim is to type less and make fewer typos.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN users say it made Vim's completion system click for them.\",\"content_type\":\"tutorial\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"vim completion\",\"categories\":[\"Testing, debugging & developer tools\"],\"tags\":[\"vim\",\"autocomplete\",\"ctags\",\"text editing\",\"thoughtbot\"],\"quote\":\"it \\\"clicked\\\" for me after watching this video\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"3WMuzhQXJoY\",\"title\":\"MEETING THE ENEMY A feminist comes to terms with the Men's Rights movement | Cassie Jaye | TEDxMarin\",\"channel\":\"TEDx Talks\",\"summary\":\"Documentary filmmaker Cassie Jaye explains how making The Red Pill led her, a feminist, to reevaluate her assumptions about the Men's Rights movement. She argues for listening to people you think of as the enemy.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it as a thoughtful account from a feminist on men's issues and the cost of saying unpopular things.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"men's rights movement\",\"categories\":[\"Social issues & culture\",\"Filmmaking & video production\"],\"tags\":[\"cassie jaye\",\"the red pill\",\"feminism\",\"tedx\",\"empathy\",\"gender\"],\"quote\":\"This is a good TEDx talk from a feminist\",\"recommenders\":4,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"3qln2u1Vr2E\",\"title\":\"AWS re:Invent 2015 | (NET403) Another Day, Another Billion Packets\",\"channel\":\"Amazon Web Services\",\"summary\":\"Eric Brandwine's AWS re:Invent 2015 session on how Amazon VPC networking works. It covers the problems the design solved, why traditional approaches do not scale, and the mechanisms used for customer isolation and VPC endpoints.\",\"why_hn\":\"Considered a favorite deep dive into how AWS does virtual networking at L3 and why VPC hosts cannot snoop each other.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"advanced\",\"primary_topic\":\"cloud virtual networking\",\"categories\":[\"Networking & internet infrastructure\",\"Cloud, DevOps & reliability\"],\"tags\":[\"aws vpc\",\"networking\",\"eric brandwine\",\"network isolation\",\"