rance\",\"categories\":[\"Productivity & self-improvement\",\"Fitness, sleep & longevity\"],\"tags\":[\"david goggins\",\"joe rogan\",\"ultramarathon\",\"motivation\",\"discipline\"],\"quote\":\"do yourself a favor\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"5u7euN1HTuU\",\"title\":\"The Kennedy Assassination: Inside the Book Depository\",\"channel\":\"LEMMiNO\",\"summary\":\"A 98-minute LEMMiNO video reconstructing what happened inside the Texas School Book Depository before, during, and after the Kennedy assassination. It draws on testimony to map people's movements and discrepancies.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it as a detailed, well-sourced overview that helps viewers form their own opinion.\",\"content_type\":\"documentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"kennedy assassination\",\"categories\":[\"World history\",\"Documentaries & storytelling\",\"Law, policing & justice\"],\"tags\":[\"jfk\",\"lee harvey oswald\",\"book depository\",\"eyewitness testimony\",\"history\"],\"quote\":\"It's long but it gives a good overview of the sequence of events and the discrepancies.\",\"recommenders\":5,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"6OPsH8PK7xM\",\"title\":\"What P vs NP is actually about\",\"channel\":\"Polylog\",\"summary\":\"Polylog explains how algorithms can be turned into circuits and encoded as satisfiability problems, which lets you effectively run them backwards. It uses this to motivate breaking RSA, general reductions to SAT, and what P vs NP is really asking.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as an intuitive, animated explanation of P vs NP framed around reversing computation.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"intro\",\"primary_topic\":\"P vs NP\",\"categories\":[\"Computability & complexity theory\",\"Algorithms & data structures\"],\"tags\":[\"p vs np\",\"sat\",\"np-completeness\",\"circuits\",\"complexity theory\"],\"quote\":\"I would highly recommend giving it a watch\",\"recommenders\":4,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"6VOQnK7O2To\",\"title\":\"Chris 