or anyone worrying about wasted time or direction.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"life advice and motivation\",\"categories\":[\"Productivity & self-improvement\",\"Tech pioneers & interviews\"],\"tags\":[\"steve jobs\",\"commencement speech\",\"stanford\",\"career\",\"death\"],\"quote\":\"I try to watch it once a year, especially with grad students and postdocs. Gets better each time.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"HhGI-GqAK9c\",\"title\":\"SIGBOVIK 2007: Generalized Super Mario Bros. is NP-Complete\",\"channel\":\"suckerpinch\",\"summary\":\"Tom Murphy's satirical SIGBOVIK 2007 presentation, delivered under a pseudonym, proving that generalized Super Mario Bros. is NP-complete. It is a short, deadpan take on a complexity theory result.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN likes it as a funny, entertaining presentation, frequently linked in threads on NP-hardness of games and NES automation.\",\"content_type\":\"comedy\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"computational complexity of games\",\"categories\":[\"Computability & complexity theory\",\"Satire & parody\"],\"tags\":[\"np-complete\",\"super mario bros\",\"sigbovik\",\"complexity theory\",\"satire\"],\"quote\":\"This guy is a genius and also freakin hilarious\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"HhGuXCuDb1U\",\"title\":\"Tim Minchin's Storm the Animated Movie\",\"channel\":\"stormmovie\",\"summary\":\"Animated adaptation of Tim Minchin's beat poem 'Storm', in which he argues with a hippie at a London dinner party. It satirizes alternative medicine and defends science and reason.\",\"why_hn\":\"Quoted often for its line on alternative medicine that works being called medicine, and recommended as a full-length listen.\",\"content_type\":\"comedy\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"science vs alternative medicine\",\"categories\":[\"Religion, belief & skepticism\",\"Satire & parody\",\"Medicine & infectious disease\"],\"tags\":[\"tim minchin\",\"beat poem\",\"skepticism\",\"homeopathy\",\"animation\"],\"quote\":\"The entirety of this song is a listen worth your time.\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"HrUy1Vn2KdI\",\"title\":\"Couldn't Care Less. Cormac McCarthy in conversation with David Krakauer\",\"channel\":\"Karol Jałochowski\",\"summary\":\"A 2017 documentary filmed at the Santa Fe Institute in which novelist Cormac McCarthy talks with SFI's David Krakauer. They discuss isolation, mathematics, character and the nature of the unconscious.\",\"why_hn\":\"It is one of the few long, candid interviews with the famously reclusive McCarthy, and commenters share it whenever he comes up.\",\"content_type\":\"documentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"cormac mccarthy\",\"categories\":[\"Literature & writing craft\",\"Consciousness & cognition\",\"Tech pioneers & interviews\"],\"tags\":[\"cormac mccarthy\",\"santa fe institute\",\"the unconscious\",\"literature\",\"interview\"],\"quote\":\"This is my favourite interview with him so I will take this post as an excuse to share it.\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"I6xwMIUPHss\",\"title\":\"The Company that Broke Canada\",\"channel\":\"BobbyBroccoli\",\"summary\":\"BobbyBroccoli documentary on the rise of Nortel Networks, once the dominant Canadian telecom giant, during the dot-com era. It is part one of a two-part story.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a well-made documentary explaining Nortel's rise and the index-fund and bubble dynamics around it.\",\"content_type\":\"documentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"nortel networks history\",\"categories\":[\"Tech company stories & documentaries\",\"Documentaries & storytelling\"],\"tags\":[\"nortel\",\"dot-com bubble\",\"canada\",\"telecom\",\"corporate history\"],\"quote\":\"BobbyBroccoli on YouTube does an absolutely phenomenal job creating documentaries.\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"IHZwWFHWa-w\",\"title\":\"Gradient descent, how neural networks learn | Deep Learning Chapter 2\",\"channel\":\"3Blue1Brown\",\"summary\":\"3Blue1Brown's second neural network chapter explains cost functions and gradient descent, showing how a network learns by minimizing error during training.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends the series as a very accessible way to understand the math behind machine learning and LLMs.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"intro\",\"primary_topic\":\"gradient descent\",\"categories\":[\"Machine learning & deep learning\"],\"tags\":[\"neural networks\",\"cost function\",\"machine learning\",\"3blue1brown\",\"deep learning\"],\"quote\":\"3Blue1Brown which explains math in very accessible way\",\"recommenders\":4,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"IJcuQQ1eWWI\",\"title\":\"Playing to Lose: AI and \\\"Civilization\\\" (Soren Johnson)\",\"channel\":\"Google TechTalks\",\"summary\":\"Soren Johnson, a lead designer and AI programmer on Civilization games, discusses game AI design, including whether AI should cheat, behave like a human or be fun rather than strong. He uses the Civilization series as a case study.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters recommend it as the key talk on why game AI is built to be fun rather than to win.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"game ai design\",\"categories\":[\"Game design\",\"AI & data (other)\"],\"tags\":[\"civilization\",\"game ai\",\"game design\",\"soren johnson\",\"ai cheating\"],\"quote\":\"Extremely enlightening, whether you are a gamer or not.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":3.5}",
    ",{\"vid\":\"IJiHDmyhE1A\",\"title\":\"Christopher Tin - Baba Yetu (Official Video) feat. Soweto Gospel Choir\",\"channel\":\"Christopher Tin\",\"summary\":\"The official video for Baba Yetu, Christopher Tin's Swahili-language choral piece written as the theme to Civilization IV. It was the first video game music to win a Grammy.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters hold it up as the greatest video game song, evoking wonder and pride in humanity.\",\"content_type\":\"music\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"video game music\",\"categories\":[\"Music performance & songs\",\"Gaming culture & analysis\"],\"tags\":[\"baba yetu\",\"civilization\",\"choral music\",\"christopher tin\",\"swahili\"],\"quote\":\"What about the greatest video game song ever produced (Baba Yetu)\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"IX-gTobCJHs\",\"title\":\"Nokia Morph Concept (long)\",\"channel\":\"Alexander Budde\",\"summary\":\"A concept video from Nokia Research Center and Cambridge Nanoscience Center showing Morph, a flexible, self-cleaning, shape-changing phone imagined through nanotechnology.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN brings it up as a nostalgic, exciting concept in threads on foldable phones and design, and sometimes as an example of concept videos that never shipped.\",\"content_type\":\"demo\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"future phone concept design\",\"categories\":[\"Consumer devices & gadgets\",\"Materials science\",\"Product & industrial design\"],\"tags\":[\"nokia\",\"nanotechnology\",\"concept video\",\"flexible devices\",\"foldable phones\"],\"quote\":\"I have just watched the video about it [2] again and I am still as excited about it as I was 11 years ago.\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"IaWdEtANi-0\",\"title\":\"People & Power - On a wing and a prayer\",\"channel\":\"Al Jazeera English\",\"summary\":\"An Al Jazeera English People & Power investigation from 2010 into safety problems with the Boeing 737NG, featuring whistleblowers on cracking