emic origins\"],\"quote\":\"Vox put out a pretty good video on wet markets recently.\",\"recommenders\":5,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"TVgQ_tgWMyU\",\"title\":\"How to recover from depression\",\"channel\":\"Psychlopaedia.org\",\"summary\":\"Clinical psychologist Dr Michael Yapko draws on forty years of practice and research to explain skills that help people recover from, and even prevent, depression. He emphasizes cognitive and social factors beyond medication.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters recommend it as a comprehensive talk on depression, and one says it helped them through a bad period.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"depression recovery\",\"categories\":[\"Mental health & neurodiversity\",\"Psychology & human behavior\"],\"tags\":[\"depression\",\"psychology\",\"michael yapko\",\"therapy\",\"mental health\"],\"quote\":\"this video helped me immensely at one point in my life\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"TVwKjGbz60k\",\"title\":\"Slavoj Žižek on \\\"They Live\\\" (The Pervert's Guide to Ideology)\",\"channel\":\"Christian G\",\"summary\":\"A short excerpt from The Pervert's Guide to Ideology in which Slavoj Zizek analyzes John Carpenter's They Live. He uses the film's fight scene and sunglasses to explain how ideology works.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN cites it as a concise, memorable explanation of ideology, often in threads about advertising, propaganda or AI-shaped narratives.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"ideology in film\",\"categories\":[\"Film analysis & criticism\",\"Philosophy & ethics\"],\"tags\":[\"zizek\",\"they live\",\"ideology\",\"film analysis\",\"philosophy\"],\"quote\":\"it finally clicked after hearing Zizek talk about it.\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":3.5},{\"vid\":\"TruCIPy79w8\",\"title\":\"Milton Friedman - Why Tax Reform Is Impossible\",\"channel\":\"LibertyPen\",\"summary\":\"Milton Friedman explains why the US tax code is enormously complex and why